{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend the Soul Stone at all costs.</strong><br>You play as a restless ghost bound to a mystical Soul Stone. When the monsters come, it\u2019s your job to protect it \u2014 by building defenses, summoning allies, and even possessing your warriors to fight on the front lines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By day, you\u2019ll expand and prepare your base. By night, endless waves of monsters attack \u2014 and survival depends on both your strategy and your combat skills.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Base Building</strong> \u2013 Place spawners, turrets, mines, and walls to create the ultimate defense.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Possession Combat</strong> \u2013 Take control of your NPC allies at any time. Dodge, slash, and fight directly to turn the tide of battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgradable Defenses</strong> \u2013 Strengthen spawners to summon tougher allies, reinforce your walls, and unlock new tools as days pass.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Day/Night Cycle</strong> \u2013 Gather resources and build during the day. Face intense, large-scale monster assaults at night.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escalating Challenge</strong> \u2013 Each midnight brings stronger enemies, bigger waves, and higher rewards. How many days can you survive?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Fantasy World</strong> \u2013 Battle demons, monsters, and supernatural foes in a stylized, atmospheric setting.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc80 Survive the Endless Nights</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only way to lose is to let your Soul Stone fall. Every decision matters \u2014 from where you build your defenses, to which ally you possess, to how you spend your limited resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will 